n":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T03:06:42Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T03:06:42Z","body":"Could we get an MRP? Without one this probably isn't going to get fixed","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5578486484/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5578785101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123246#issuecomment-5578785101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123246","id":5578785101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTIWBTQ","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T03:41:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T03:41:11Z","body":"Oh, I see, it does look like it's highlighting-related. I just tried again and couldn't reproduce it on a comment line, but I reproduced it with a line of code like...\n`extends [10k spaces]`\n\nSorry, I should've been specific about the kind of line of code. Do I have to provide a MRP though? You can get this in 10 secs with some copypasting","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5578785101/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5578891611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123246#issuecomment-5578891611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123246","id":5578891611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTIchWw","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T03:52:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T04:03:20Z","body":"**Here's an MRP of a long \"GDScript\" file (really just 5,000 random ASCII characters on a single line): [test-long-gdscript_2026-09-07_20-58-22.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31935964/test-long-gdscript_2026-09-07_20-58-22.zip)**\n\nI get very noticeable lag when trying to modify the line of text (although no crashes, since there's no valid GDScript for the parser to try to parse and run into recursion errors with).\n\n---\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Previous version of comment, showing issues with parsing long-but-valid GDScript, which is a different bug</summary>\n\nOkay, so I went to create an MRP for this using a simple Python script:\n```py\nnum_items = 1000\nwith open(\"long_gdscript.gd\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(\"\"\"\nextends Node\nfunc get_one() -> int: return 1\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    var my_val: int =\"\"\")\n    for i in range(num_items):\n        f.write(\" get_one()\")\n        if i != num_items - 1:\n            f.write(\" +\")\n    f.write(\"\\n    print(my_val)\\n\")\n```\nWhich gave me a 12 KB file of a bunch of `get_one()` calls strung together. I then tried to open it in v4.8.dev.custom_build [6a0f6f32c] and... it just fully crashed Godot 😅\n\nSetting `num_items = 100` does not crash Godot, and I don't notice any lag when editing the file.\n\n- `num_items = 100` - no lag\n- `num_items = 500` - some noticeable lag\n- `num_items = 800` - Godot crashes seemingly due to recursion:\n```\nThread 0 Crashed::  Dispatch queue: com.apple.main-thread\n0   godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e4418 GDScriptCompiler::_gdtype_from_datatype(GDScriptParser::DataType const&, GDScript*, bool) + 20 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:90)\n1   godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8098 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 12992 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:874)\n2   godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 742\n3   godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 741\n4   godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 740\n--------\n-------- ELIDED 736 LEVELS OF RECURSION THROUGH 0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n--------\n741 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 3\n742 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 2\n743 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023e8314 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_expression(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, Error&, GDScriptParser::ExpressionNode const*, bool, bool) + 13628 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:910)\n-------- RECURSION LEVEL 1\n744 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023f07a0 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_block(GDScriptCompiler::CodeGen&, GDScriptParser::SuiteNode const*, bool, bool) + 5132 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:2222)\n745 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023eca84 GDScriptCompiler::_parse_function(Error&, GDScript*, GDScriptParser::ClassNode const*, GDScriptParser::FunctionNode const*, bool, bool) + 3520 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:2480)\n746 godot.macos.editor.dev.arm64  \t       0x1023f43f8 GDScriptCompiler::_compile_class(GDScript*, GDScriptParser::ClassNode const*, bool) + 180 (gdscript_compiler.cpp:3022)\n```\n</summary>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5578891611/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5593092998","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123246#issuecomment-5593092998","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123246","id":5593092998,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTV_Thg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T23:06:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T23:06:20Z","body":"First, if word wrap is enabled then that is the issue.\nIf its not, then it is syntax highlighting.\n\nThe specific line is relevant, since it hits different code in the syntax highlighter. I profiled on this line as described:\n```gdscript\nextends                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \n```\nAnd here is the flame graph:\n\n<img width=\"1883\" height=\"622\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e050929-9b4e-437f-880e-4d4ca7ad777e\" />\n\n\nIt's calling `strip_edges` a lot, it is caused by one line in particular that looks like it runs for every single character in the line, even though it only needs to run once per line.\n\n<img width=\"690\" height=\"97\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3696c93-fc71-4bd7-a329-fc7c2b729498\" />\n\nI'll open a PR fixing it and improving other parts of the highlighter.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5593092998/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5621495525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123246#issuecomment-5621495525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123246","id":5621495525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTxE25Q","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-10T15:50:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T15:50:48Z","body":"Xcode Instruments and my test project with a massive line of random characters (and no valid GDScript keywords) brought me to this line as a culprit for slowdown:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/modules/gdscript/editor/gdscript_highlighter.cpp#L510-L512\n\nThat makes sense to me, if I'm reading the code correctly - I think it's basically trying to read every character in the line in sequence, until it finds something valid to latch onto. It also looks like it's happening as a _nested_ loop (we're iterating over every character in the line via the `for` loop on line 105), so we end up running `line_length^2` times 😅 \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5621495525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5621739653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123246#issuecomment-5